      "about": [
        "nl-ma",
        "C-2024-0820",
        "INV-2026-N0009",
        "INV-2026-N0010"
      ],
      "text": "Subject: Payment run. We pay on the 15th and the last day of each month. An invoice that reaches us after the 10th waits for the next run, and the PO reference on the invoice must match our order, otherwise AP blocks it. Your last two invoices carried the old PO number. We will release invoice INV-2026-N0009 once it is corrected."
    },
    {
      "id": "S-02",
      "kind": "Call",
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "contact": "petersen",
      "entity": "nl-en",
      "about": [
        "nl-en",
        "C-2023-0517",
        "O-7102",
        "T-30502",
        "ostertag"
      ],
      "text": "Call with Jens Petersen. Energietechnik wants about 20 percent more users for service technicians and asks us to hold the price. He needs the Joule agent to read service orders, ticket T-30502 is still open. The renewal decision is with the Group CFO Marlene Ostertag, who wants consolidated terms across the subsidiaries. Decision date is 1 December 2026."
    },
