        "INV-2026-L0099",
        "SO-81355",
        "C-2025-0233"
      ],
      "text": "Subject: Invoice INV-2026-L0099 rejected. The invoice for the two additional Logistik sites is addressed to Nordlicht Logistik GmbH. Under contract C-2025-0233 Business Services is the bill-to party, so we cannot post it. Please re-issue it to Business Services; the payment run follows after posting."
    },
    {
      "id": "S-04",
