        "C-2023-0102",
        "O-7104",
        "T-30511"
      ],
      "text": "Call with Tomasz Wrona, Head of IT in Gdańsk. The Employee Central contract ended on 31 May and the tenant is read-only. Poland is looking at a local HR partner and expects no decision before Q1 2027. He is open to a call with an executive sponsor."
    },
    {
