      ],
      "text": "Chat note from Sven Albrecht. Henrik Voss wants a group view before the Joule pilot decision on 30 December: which subsidiaries adopt, what it costs, and how many invoices the group receives. The Group CFO supports a single framework if payment terms stay simple."
    },
